WEBVTT

00:14.801 --> 00:16.732
Attention, everyone.
大家注意了。

00:16.732 --> 00:21.697
Gather round for a free concert
of beautiful music.
聚集在一起参加免费音乐会
优美的音乐。

00:21.697 --> 00:23.904
Oh, a free concert.
哦，免费音乐会。

00:23.904 --> 00:25.456
Fantastic.
极好的。

00:25.456 --> 00:27.560
And a one, and a two...
还有一个一，一个二……

00:32.318 --> 00:36.249
Oh, get me out of here, Chad.
哦，带我离开这里，查德。

00:42.629 --> 00:46.077
Oh, my ears are offended.
哦，我的耳朵被冒犯了。

00:52.318 --> 00:56.249
Oh, hey. Ow, ow, ow.
哦，嘿。噢，噢，噢。

01:04.180 --> 01:06.801
Hey, hey, what's going on?
Put me down.
嘿嘿嘿，这是怎么回事？
把我放下来。

01:06.801 --> 01:09.491
Let go of my legs.
My clarinet.
放开我的腿。
我的单簧管。

01:15.525 --> 01:16.904
Philistines.
非利士人。

01:48.387 --> 01:52.008
One, more time.
再一次。

01:52.008 --> 01:54.008
Freeze, mister.
冻结吧，先生。

01:54.008 --> 01:57.870
Put the clarinet down
nice and slow.
把单簧管放下
又好又慢。

01:57.870 --> 02:01.318
Who are you supposed to be?
The music police?
你应该是谁？
音乐警察？

02:01.318 --> 02:02.870
That's right, fella.
没错，伙计。

02:09.042 --> 02:10.560
And you are in violation of
并且你违反了

02:10.560 --> 02:12.697
section four
of the symphony code.
第四节
交响乐代码。

02:12.697 --> 02:15.835
Reckless playing
of a reed instrument.
鲁莽玩耍
是一种簧片乐器。

02:15.835 --> 02:19.663
Your clarinet is officially
out of commission.
你的单簧管正式
停止使用。

02:19.663 --> 02:21.525
What the...
什么...

02:21.525 --> 02:23.008
Hey!
嘿！

02:23.008 --> 02:24.835
If you want that boot
off your clarinet,
如果你想要那双靴子
关掉你的单簧管，

02:24.835 --> 02:28.732
you'll have to undergo
mandatory music reeducation.
你将不得不经历
强制性音乐再教育。

02:28.732 --> 02:31.870
Oh, you got to be kidding me.
哦，你一定是在开玩笑。

02:36.939 --> 02:39.835
Little Flipper Music Academy.
小脚蹼音乐学院。

02:39.835 --> 02:43.904
Oh, no. I am not going
to any school for minnows.
哦，不。我不去
去任何一所小鱼学校。

02:50.663 --> 02:54.042
Hey, you can't degrade me
like this.
嘿，你不能贬低我
像这样。

02:54.042 --> 02:55.973
Yeah, that's what
they all say.
是的，就是这样
他们都说。

02:55.973 --> 02:58.629
<i>Calling Guard 38,
a drummer missed a beat</i>
<i>呼叫守卫 38，
鼓手错过了一个节拍</i>

02:58.629 --> 03:00.904
<i>at the jazz club on Bebop Way.</i>
<i>在 Bebop Way 的爵士俱乐部。</i>

03:00.904 --> 03:02.904
Let's rock and roll.
让我们一起摇滚吧。

03:06.249 --> 03:10.973
I wouldn't be caught dead
sitting in front of this class.
我不会被抓死
坐在这个班级的前面。

03:10.973 --> 03:14.594
They won't see me back here.
他们不会看到我回到这里。

03:14.594 --> 03:16.766
Good morning, class.
早上好，同学们。

03:16.766 --> 03:19.835
Would everyone please
turn their chairs around?
请大家
把他们的椅子转过来？

03:19.835 --> 03:23.904
- Yes, Ms. Sturgeon.
- Huh? What?
- 是的，斯特金女士。
- 啊？什么？

03:23.904 --> 03:26.284
Oh, for Neptune's sake.
哦，看在海王星的份上。

03:26.284 --> 03:28.422
It looks like we have
a new student
看起来我们有
一个新学生

03:28.422 --> 03:30.353
sitting right up front today.
今天就坐在前面。

03:30.353 --> 03:33.629
Will you stand and introduce
yourself to the class?
请您站起来介绍一下
你自己去上课吗？

03:36.111 --> 03:40.008
My name is Squidward Tentacles
and I've been playing clarinet
我的名字是章鱼触手
我一直在吹单簧管

03:40.008 --> 03:42.732
longer than you all
have been alive.
比你们都长
已经活着了。

03:42.732 --> 03:45.973
And why are you here,
Mr. Tentacles?
还有你为什么在这里，
触手先生？

03:45.973 --> 03:48.146
Because of a court order.
因为法院命令。

03:48.146 --> 03:51.904
- Court order?
- Squidward got a court order.
- 法庭命令？
- 章鱼哥收到了法庭命令。

03:51.904 --> 03:54.491
all: Squidward got
a court order.
全部： 章鱼哥得到
法院命令。

03:54.491 --> 03:55.801
Hey, stop it.
嘿，别说了。

03:55.801 --> 03:57.801
Now, settle down, class.
现在，安静下来，上课。

03:57.801 --> 03:59.456
Oh, yes.
哦是的。

03:59.456 --> 04:03.973
We have one more new student
joining us today.
我们又多了一位新同学
今天加入我们。

04:03.973 --> 04:06.284
Hello.
I'm SpongeBob SquarePants
你好。
我是海绵宝宝

04:06.284 --> 04:09.180
and I'm really looking forward...
我真的很期待...

04:09.180 --> 04:13.525
Squidward, I didn't know you
were taking this class too.
章鱼哥，我不认识你
也在上这门课。

04:17.697 --> 04:19.491
Isn't this wonderful?
这不是很棒吗？

04:19.491 --> 04:21.387
We're musical classmates.
我们是音乐系同学。

04:21.387 --> 04:22.939
Kill me now.
现在就杀了我吧。

04:22.939 --> 04:25.870
To begin, I would like
each of you to play
首先，我想
你们每个人都来玩

04:25.870 --> 04:28.180
your instrument to gauge
everyone's skill level.
您的测量仪器
每个人的技能水平。

04:28.180 --> 04:31.077
We'll go around the classroom
one by one.
我们绕着教室转一圈
一一。

04:31.077 --> 04:34.077
Fergus, would you start us off?
弗格斯，你能让我们开始吗？

04:40.215 --> 04:43.284
Good effort, Fergus. Nellie.
干得好，弗格斯。内莉。

04:48.456 --> 04:51.491
Interesting technique.
有趣的技术。

04:51.491 --> 04:55.111
Otto, would you play
a little on your key-tar?
奥托，你愿意玩吗？
你的钥匙焦油上有一点吗？

05:00.939 --> 05:04.594
Hmm. Definitely room
for improvement.
唔。绝对有房间
以便改进。

05:04.594 --> 05:07.077
Student SquarePants,
学生方裤，

05:07.077 --> 05:10.146
would you give us a taste
of your musical talents?
你能给我们尝尝吗
你的音乐天赋？

05:10.146 --> 05:11.973
Certainly.
当然。

05:23.629 --> 05:25.387
Whoa.
哇哦。

05:39.560 --> 05:43.146
Excellent nose flute
technique, Mr. SquarePants.
优秀的鼻笛
技术，方裤先生。

05:43.146 --> 05:45.249
Now, it's time for
Mr. Tentacles
现在，是时候了
触手先生

05:45.249 --> 05:48.560
to demonstrate
his musical abilities.
展示
他的音乐能力。

05:51.353 --> 05:55.491
Now, let me show you
how it's really done.
现在，让我向您展示
它是如何真正完成的。

05:57.732 --> 05:59.904
Whoo! Go, Squidward.
呼！走吧，章鱼哥。

06:01.353 --> 06:04.870
Brace yourselves for you
are about to witness
为你做好准备
即将见证

06:04.870 --> 06:09.284
a stroke of pure genius.
纯粹天才的一击。

06:21.801 --> 06:24.629
It did sound like
听起来确实像

06:24.629 --> 06:27.732
you had some kind of stroke.
你中风了。

06:27.732 --> 06:29.318
The clarinet may be too
单簧管也可以

06:29.318 --> 06:31.353
advanced for your level,
Mr. Tentacles.
适合您的水平，
触手先生。

06:31.353 --> 06:33.870
Perhaps you should try
a different instrument.
也许你应该尝试
不同的乐器。

06:51.387 --> 06:52.732
Ow.
噢。

06:58.629 --> 06:59.801
Huh.
呵呵。

07:09.594 --> 07:12.697
Uh, maybe you should just
work on your fingering.
呃，也许你应该
练习指法。

07:36.766 --> 07:38.008
That's it.
就是这样。

07:38.008 --> 07:40.008
I've had enough
of this nonsense.
我已经受够了
这种废话。

07:54.491 --> 07:59.042
Must pull music alarm.
必须拉音乐闹钟。

08:03.491 --> 08:09.353
all:
全部：

08:14.318 --> 08:16.008
Squidward Tentacles,
章鱼哥的触手，

08:16.008 --> 08:19.560
put down the clarinet before
someone's eardrums get hurt.
之前放下单簧管
有人的耳膜受伤了。

08:20.835 --> 08:24.215
Come and take it, copper.
来吧，铜。

08:35.870 --> 08:39.215
He's getting too powerful.
What do we do now?
他变得太强大了。
我们现在做什么？

08:39.215 --> 08:43.560
Send in the maestro.
送大师来。

08:58.766 --> 09:01.318
Huh?
啊？

09:04.111 --> 09:07.732
- Fun's over, bad-toven.
- Huh?
- 乐趣结束了，坏家伙。
- 啊？

09:07.732 --> 09:11.111
Up top.
上顶。

09:11.111 --> 09:13.077
You won't be hurting
你不会受伤

09:13.077 --> 09:15.077
anyone with this anymore.
任何人再有这个。

09:21.146 --> 09:24.870
Your villainous vibrato
days are over.
你邪恶的颤音
日子已经过去了。

09:27.318 --> 09:30.697
I'll never play music again.
我再也不会玩音乐了。

09:30.697 --> 09:33.629
Don't worry, Squidward.
You can take up a new hobby.
别担心，章鱼哥。
你可以培养一个新的爱好。

09:33.629 --> 09:36.525
Like lint sorting or
competitive thumb twiddling.
就像皮棉排序或
竞争性的拇指转动。

09:36.525 --> 09:39.353
Or...
- I don't have any thumbs.
或者...
- 我没有拇指。

09:39.353 --> 09:41.456
Ah.
啊。

09:41.456 --> 09:45.077
Go ahead and give
it a big blow, buddy.
继续并给予
这是一个很大的打击，伙计。

09:48.525 --> 09:50.180
That sound.
那个声音。

09:53.008 --> 09:57.318
Positively angelic.
积极天使。

09:57.318 --> 09:59.456
Keep going, Squidward.
继续前进，章鱼哥。

09:59.456 --> 10:01.629
You finally found
your instrument.
你终于找到了
你的乐器。

10:01.629 --> 10:04.422
It was right in front
of your nose all along.
就在前面
一直都是你的鼻子。

10:04.422 --> 10:06.870
In fact, it was your nose.
事实上，那是你的鼻子。

10:14.077 --> 10:15.973
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

10:15.973 --> 10:18.318
I think we can all agree,
我想我们都可以同意

10:18.318 --> 10:23.008
Mr. Tentacles is the most
improved student in the class.
触手先生是最
班上进步的学生。

10:35.077 --> 10:38.422
- What a talent.
- Encore. Encore.
- 多么有才华啊。
- 安可。安可。

10:38.422 --> 10:40.939
Whoo. Way to go, Squidward.
呼。干得好，章鱼哥。

10:40.939 --> 10:43.560
Encore. Encore.
- Encore.
安可。安可。
- 安可。

10:50.973 --> 10:52.249
Ow.
噢。

噢。